Cell["\<\
At a path endpoint there is one ray and no line; at an interior vertex the \
rays are the two halves of the one axis.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"9472b9bc-f75b-4dca-b6a1-4ffbb40c269d"],

