Cell["\<\
A star has a ray to every leaf, and any two are perpendicular: the rays \
number the leaves, the axes at most half of them.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"9eda87ec-a15b-4d5f-a309-45e90f5fcb70"],

